      "sourceHash": "66723265ee5fe0a52cef7ef0674f0c247be0608ffcbc9af4f5a4da187a60d2e0",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.04,
          "end": 4.41,
          "en": "So that's how icons can be added.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.41,
          "end": 7.44,
          "en": "As I mentioned, I also wanna tweak this image here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.44,
          "end": 8.37,
          "en": "a little bit though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.37,
          "end": 11.07,
          "en": "and I wanna make it slightly transparent.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.07,
          "end": 14.19,
          "en": "Now, there are two main ways of doing that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.19,
          "end": 16.68,
          "en": "and whilst one approach is better than the other,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.68,
          "end": 18.96,
          "en": "I still want to show you both here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 18.96,
          "end": 21.78,
          "en": "The first approach, which is typically not recommended,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21.78,
          "end": 23.67,
          "en": "but which you should still know,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 23.67,
          "end": 27.48,
          "en": "is that you wrap this image widget with another widget.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 27.48,
          "end": 30.36,
          "en": "Now, not a widget, which is suggested here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 30.36,
          "end": 32.58,
          "en": "but instead we can use this generic wrap",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 32.58,
          "end": 36.15,
          "en": "with widget refactoring action here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 36.15,
          "end": 39.18,
          "en": "and then we can enter the widget name here manually.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 39.18,
          "end": 43.32,
          "en": "In this case, it's the opacity widget, which I want to use.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 43.32,
          "end": 47.55,
          "en": "Now, the opacity widget then does not just need",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 47.55,
          "end": 49.287,
          "en": "a named child argument,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 49.287,
          "end": 53.1,
          "en": "but instead it also needs an opacity argument.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 53.1,
          "end": 55.579,
          "en": "And indeed, this opacity argument is required.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 55.579,
          "end": 59.55,
          "en": "It must be said when using this Opacity widget.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 59.55,
          "end": 63.18,
          "en": "And opacity now takes a number value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 63.18,
          "end": 68.18,
          "en": "between 0.0 and 1.0, where 1.0 is fully opaque,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 68.49,
          "end": 70.11,
          "en": "so fully visible,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 70.11,
          "end": 74.94,
          "en": "and 0.0 is fully transparent, so fully invisible.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 74.94,
          "end": 78.03,
          "en": "So if I set this to 0.5 here, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 78.03,
          "end": 81.843,
          "en": "you'll see that now this image has some transparency.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 82.68,
          "end": 85.98,
          "en": "If I set it to 0.1, this is even clearer to see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 85.98,
          "end": 88.71000000000001,
          "en": "because now it's almost invisible.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 88.71000000000001,
          "end": 92.88,
          "en": "So that's one way of setting the transparency of a widget,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 92.88,
          "end": 96.834,
          "en": "of the widget that is wrapped by transparency to be precise.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 96.834,
          "end": 99.66,
          "en": "Now, this can be useful, but behind the scenes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 99.66,
          "end": 102.36,
          "en": "this is quite performance-intensive.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 102.36,
          "end": 105.03,
          "en": "Not a huge problem for this basic app here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 105.03,
          "end": 108.45,
          "en": "but typically you should avoid using opacity",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 108.45,
          "end": 110.4,
          "en": "if you can avoid it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 110.4,
          "end": 114.27000000000001,
          "en": "And that's why I'll copy this and then comment it out",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 114.27000000000001,
          "end": 118.65,
          "en": "and re-add it, but now I'll remove this Opacity widget here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 118.65,
          "end": 121.47,
          "en": "and go back to just having the Image.asset here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 121.47,
          "end": 124.08,
          "en": "and show you an alternative approach.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 124.08,
          "end": 126.06,
          "en": "Because whenever you have a widget",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 126.06,
          "end": 127.95,
          "en": "where you can set a color,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 127.95,
          "end": 130.02,
          "en": "there is a better approach available,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 130.02,
          "end": 132.81,
          "en": "a better approach than using opacity.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 132.81,
          "end": 135,
          "en": "And it turns out that for image,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 135,
          "end": 138.51,
          "en": "you can set a color argument when using",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 138.51,
          "end": 141.24,
          "en": "this asset constructor function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 141.24,
          "end": 143.28,
          "en": "and this color can be used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 143.28,
          "end": 146.88,
          "en": "to apply some transparency to this image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 146.88,
          "end": 149.82,
          "en": "Now for a start, let's set this to colors.red,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 149.82,
          "end": 152.4,
          "en": "so to the standard built-in red color,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 152.4,
          "end": 154.17000000000002,
          "en": "and let's see what that does.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 154.17000000000002,
          "end": 156.66,
          "en": "And as you see, it changes the color of the image,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 156.66,
          "end": 158.43,
          "en": "and that's also good to know.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 158.43,
          "end": 162.54,
          "en": "This color argument on the image widget can be used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 162.54,
          "end": 165.57,
          "en": "to add an overlay color on top of the image,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 165.57,
          "end": 169.07999999999998,
          "en": "which sometimes can be exactly the effect you want,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 169.07999999999998,
          "end": 171,
          "en": "but this gets even more powerful",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 171,
          "end": 173.79,
          "en": "if you now apply a transparent color here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 173.79,
          "end": 176.34,
          "en": "And for that here, since I want to keep my image white,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 176.34,
          "end": 178.47,
          "en": "I'll first of all switch to white",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 178.47,
          "end": 181.47,
          "en": "and then here we have this transparency slider.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 181.47,
          "end": 184.11,
          "en": "And here it's fully opaque if this is at the top.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 184.11,
          "end": 186.42,
          "en": "Here at the bottom, it would be invisible.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 186.42,
          "end": 190.5,
          "en": "And we can now tweak this and maybe go somewhere here",
