          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 205.82999999999998,
          "end": 209.01,
          "en": "And if you do that now, you got a white image again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 209.01,
          "end": 211.74,
          "en": "but a slightly transparent image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 211.74,
          "end": 213.96,
          "en": "And of course here, you can also play around with that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 213.96,
